# Pinned spark-sdk commit that glow-app's build pipeline expects.
#
# CI checks out the SHA directly. To move glow-app onto a newer
# spark-sdk commit, update the SHA on the last non-comment line and
# commit. scripts/resolve-spark-sdk.sh reads only the first
# non-comment, non-blank line as the SHA. The pinned commit must
# exist on origin (breez/spark-sdk) for CI to check it out.
#
# Pin: keep this on a released spark-sdk tag and in step with the
# @breeztech/breez-sdk-spark version in glow-web/package.json: the
# native bindings and the WASM SDK must come from the same commit, or
# the passkey plugin fails to build.
